C; P46BDVgSyp omit."}]}],"28267":[{"footnoteId":10336,"paragraphs":[{"pid":163,"text":"“The Christ,” ACDItVgSyh,p; א, “God”; B, “God that is in Christ Jesus.”"}]}],"28274":[{"footnoteId":10337,"paragraphs":[{"pid":164,"text":"Lit., “anathema.” Gr. and Lat., a·naʹthe·ma."}]}],"28275":[{"footnoteId":10338,"paragraphs":[{"pid":165,"text":"“Sacred service.” Gr., la·treiʹa; J17(Heb.), weha·ʽavoh·dhahʹ, “and the service (worship).” See Ex 12:25 ftn."}]}],"28276":[{"footnoteId":10339,"paragraphs":[{"pid":166,"text":"For a discussion of “God, who is over all” see App 6D."}]}],"28288":[{"footnoteId":10340,"paragraphs":[{"pid":167,"text":"“I have let you remain,” J17,18,22; אAB, “I have raised you up”; Ex 9:16 in LXX, which Paul here quotes, “you have been preserved.”"}]}],"28299":[{"footnoteId":10341,"paragraphs":[{"pid":168,"text":"See App 1D."}]},{"footnoteId":10342,"paragraphs":[{"pid":169,"text":"Or, “executing it speedily.”"}]}],"28300":[{"footnoteId":10343,"paragraphs":[{"pid":170,"text":"See App 1D."}]}],"28304":[{"footnoteId":10344,"paragraphs":[{"pid":171,"text":"Or, “him.”"}]},{"footnoteId":10345,"paragraphs":[{"pid":172,"text":"Or, “not be ashamed.”"}]}],"28306":[{"footnoteId":10346,"paragraphs":[{"pid":173,"text":"“I bear . . . witness.” Gr., mar·ty·roʹ; Lat., te·sti·moʹni·um . . . per·hiʹbe·o."}]}],"28308":[{"footnoteId":10347,"paragraphs":[{"pid":174,"text":"Or, “the accomplished (completed) end.” Gr., teʹlos."}]}],"28312":[{"footnoteId":10348,"paragraphs":[{"pid":175,"text":"Or, “we are heralding.” Gr., ke·rysʹso·men; Lat., prae·di·caʹmus. Compare Da 5:29 ftn, “Heralded.”"}]}],"28313":[{"footnoteId":10349,"paragraphs":[{"pid":176,"text":"Gr., kyʹri·os; J12-14,16-18,22(Heb.), ha·ʼa·dhohnʹ, “the Lord.” Not “Jehovah.”"}]}],"28315":[{"footnoteId":10350,"paragraphs":[{"pid":177,"text":"Or, “ashamed.”"}]}],"28317":[{"footnoteId":10351,"paragraphs":[{"pid":178,"text":"See App 1D."}]}],"28320":[{"footnoteId":10352,"paragraphs":[{"pid":179,"text":"See App 1D."}]}],"283